                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Home has no title (coins only). Collection: centered pink 30. Quests: left brown 28. Rankings: left brown + trophy icon. PvP and Gifts: hero card with icon tile and subtitle. Loadouts: left pink 36 + sword icon on a white band. Spectate: indigo title. Match history: pink 28 + subtitle.",
